[component]
name: Try / Catch Errors
category: Control Structures
description: Run steps and handle the errors that may happen.

[interaction]
title Try / Except
text! error | Error type | Exception
text var | Error variable | e
check finally | Add a Finally part | 0

[template]
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> Try
try:
<PWCT:IF> <var>
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> Catch <error> as <var>
except <error> as <var|ident>:
<PWCT:ELSE>
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> Catch <error>
except <error>:
<PWCT:ENDIF>
<PWCT:IF> <finally>
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> Finally
finally:
<PWCT:ENDIF>
